############################# # Exercise Group Introduction #############################
BEGIN_PGML Since the year 2010, the percent of wealth in the United States that is held by the wealthiest 1% has followed the formula [`p=0.339(n-2010)+28.3`] where [`n`] is the year.
END_PGML
###### # Body ######
BEGIN_PGML What percent of wealth in the United States was held by the wealthiest 1% in the year [$n]?
[_]{$p}{10}
END_PGML
